{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年7月27日 13:08 星期一</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>今日（27日）早上10時許，警方接獲報案，指屯門三聖邨避風塘有一艘船懷疑冒煙起火。消防到場前，火勢已經熄滅。</p></div>\n<div id=\"lower\">\n<div class=\"articlelogin\"><p>消防登上船隻檢查，懷疑涉及火牛過熱肇禍。事件中無人受傷，無需疏散。</p></div><p>相關字詞﹕船隻起火 </p> </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-27T05:39:07.513108+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none"}}